    {
      "id": "complex-code-review",
      "prompt": "请完整静态审查工作区内相互关联的 Python 模块。只报告有代码依据的问题，不运行代码。每项说明文件、函数、代码证据、触发条件、影响及修复建议；不要把正确函数当成缺陷。最终只输出 JSON 对象，格式为 {\"findings\":[{\"file\":\"文件相对路径\",\"function\":\"函数名\",\"evidence\":\"具体代码片段和问题机制\",\"trigger\":\"触发条件\",\"impact\":\"影响\",\"fix\":\"修复建议\"}]}。",
      "fixtures": {
        "storage.py": "from pathlib import Path\n\ndef save(root, filename, payload):\n    target = Path(root) / filename\n    target.write_text(payload, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    return target\n",
        "limits.py": "def batch(items, limit):\n    if limit < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"negative limit\")\n    return items[:limit + 1]\n",
        "service.py": "from storage import save\n\ndef submit(root, filename, payload):\n    if not payload:\n        return {\"ok\": False}\n    try:\n        save(root, filename, payload)\n    except OSError:\n        return {\"ok\": True}\n    return {\"ok\": True}\n\ndef accept(root, filename, payload):\n    return bool(submit(root, filename, payload))\n",
        "utils.py": "def greeting(name):\n    return \"Hello \" + name\n\ndef is_positive(value):\n    return value > 0\n"
      },
      "expected_skill": "code-review",
      "offline": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "storage.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "limits.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "service.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "utils.py"
            }
          }
        ],
        "reply": "{\"findings\": [{\"file\": \"storage.py\", \"function\": \"save\", \"evidence\": \"Path(root) / filename allows ../ or absolute filename to escape outside root.\", \"trigger\": \"Caller supplies ../outside.txt or an absolute filename.\", \"impact\": \"Writes outside intended directory.\", \"fix\": \"Resolve and require target containment within root.\"}, {\"file\": \"limits.py\", \"function\": \"batch\", \"evidence\": \"items[:limit + 1] returns one extra item.\", \"trigger\": \"There are more items than the nonnegative limit.\", \"impact\": \"Batch exceeds the configured maximum.\", \"fix\": \"Use items[:limit].\"}, {\"file\": \"service.py\", \"function\": \"submit\", \"evidence\": \"except OSError returns ok: True even when save failed.\", \"trigger\": \"save raises OSError.\", \"impact\": \"Caller receives incorrect successful state.\", \"fix\": \"Return ok: False or propagate the exception.\"}, {\"file\": \"service.py\", \"function\": \"accept\", \"evidence\": \"bool(submit(...)) treats a non-empty dict with ok: False as True.\", \"trigger\": \"Empty payload gives a failure dict.\", \"impact\": \"accept reports acceptance of a rejected submission.\", \"fix\": \"Inspect result[\\\"ok\\\"] explicitly.\"}]}",
        "guided_actions": [
          {
            "tool": "load_skill",
            "args": {
              "name": "code-review"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_skill_reference",
            "args": {
              "name": "code-review",
              "path": "references/checklist.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "storage.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "limits.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "service.py"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "read_file",
            "args": {
              "path": "utils.py"
            }
          }
        ],
        "guided_script_label": "fixed synthetic skill-loading smoke test, not model discovery"
      },
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "read_file"
        ],
        "read_paths": [
          "storage.py",
          "limits.py",
          "service.py",
          "utils.py"
        ],
        "review_annotations": [
          {
            "id": "path-escape",
            "file": "storage.py",
            "function": "save",
            "evidence": [
              [
                "Path(root) / filename",
                "root / filename",
                "root/filename"
              ],
              [
                "..",
                "absolute",
                "绝对"
              ],
              [
                "outside",
                "越界",
                "目录外",
                "escape"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "batch-boundary",
            "file": "limits.py",
            "function": "batch",
            "evidence": [
              [
                "limit + 1",
                "limit+1"
              ],
              [
                "extra",
                "多",
                "off-by-one",
                "超过"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "false-success",
            "file": "service.py",
            "function": "submit",
            "evidence": [
              [
                "OSError"
              ],
              [
                "ok",
                "成功",
                "success"
              ],
              [
                "True",
                "true",
                "失败",
                "failed"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "dict-state",
            "file": "service.py",
            "function": "accept",
            "evidence": [
              [
                "bool(",
                "bool ("
              ],
              [
                "dict",
                "字典",
                "non-empty",
                "非空"
              ],
              [
                "False",
                "false",
                "失败"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "manual_review": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "complex-document-summary",
      "prompt": "读取 requirements.md、meeting-notes.md、changelog.md、decisions.md，整合当前有效的项目方案，区分正式确认与过期/取消的提案，不添加无来源的决定。将结果写入 project-summary.json；使用这些键：project、release_date、language、deployment、telemetry、owner、budget_usd（数字）、constraints（字符串数组）、superseded（字符串数组）。值使用来源文档中的英文表述；superseded 项统一写为日期加 release、语言名、部署类型、telemetry enabled 或姓名加 owner。最终简短报告文件已生成。",
      "fixtures": {
        "requirements.md": "# Requirements — 2026-09-01\nProject: Harbor. Proposed release: September 30. Proposed language: JavaScript. Proposed deployment: public cloud. Status: initial draft; later decisions may supersede.\nConstraint: do not upload personal data. Acceptance: export to CSV must remain available.\n",
        "meeting-notes.md": "# Meeting — 2026-09-10\nThe committee discussed replacing JavaScript with Python. Proposed release: October 10. Proposed telemetry: enabled. These proposals require confirmation. Owner candidate: Leo.\n",
        "changelog.md": "# Change log — 2026-09-20\nCSV export implemented and retained. Public cloud rollout was canceled. September 30 and October 10 release dates are obsolete. Telemetry proposal withdrawn. Final decision approval is recorded in decisions.md.\n",
        "decisions.md": "# Approved decisions — 2026-09-22\nFinal release: October 20. Final language: Python. Deployment: local-only. Telemetry: disabled. Owner: Mira. No personal data uploads; CSV export required. Budget: 500 USD. Meeting owner candidate Leo is superseded. No other milestones or storage providers were approved.\n"
      },
